Description: getFromName() and getFromIndex() did not close the entry when zip_fread() failed or read nothing (PHP 8.4.23, not in this branch); brought onto the PHP 5 code of 5.6 by hand; its tests not taken (PHP 7 and later)
Origin: php-src commit 17f67529fd797da80176fbf5a591e89bf974434b (ndossche, 06.06.2026, PHP 8.4.23)

diff --git a/ext/zip/php_zip.c b/ext/zip/php_zip.c
index ec338f2..f8f9103 100644
--- a/ext/zip/php_zip.c
+++ b/ext/zip/php_zip.c
@@ -2802,6 +2802,7 @@ static void php_zip_get_from(INTERNAL_FUNCTION_PARAMETERS, int type) /* {{{ */
 	buffer = safe_emalloc(len, 1, 2);
 	n = zip_fread(zf, buffer, len);
 	if (n < 1) {
+		zip_fclose(zf);
 		efree(buffer);
 		RETURN_EMPTY_STRING();
 	}
